    "body": "## Summary\n- add a read-only admin endpoint for account reactivation audit history\n- return target user, acting administrator identity, status transition and timestamp newest-first\n- validate that the target account exists before reading history\n- add regression coverage for audit mapping and actor identity\n- update account/access documentation to reflect the audited suspension/reactivation boundary\n\n## Safety\nThis does not create any new status mutation path. Suspension remains restricted to reviewed-report enforcement and reactivation remains the narrow generic admin recovery path. The audit response contains no location, escrow, route or job-private data.\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build and existing runtime/smoke gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
